DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/cloudforce-one/rules/structured/{id}
Delete an existing structured email rule.
Required: account_id (path) — Cloudflare account ID.; id (path) — The unique identifier for the rule.

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/cloudforce-one/rules/structured/{id}
Get a structured email rule by ID.
Required: account_id (path) — Cloudflare account ID.; id (path) — The unique identifier for the rule.

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/cloudforce-one/rules/{id}
Get a single rule by ID.
Required: account_id (path) — Cloudflare account ID.; id (path) — The unique identifier for the rule.

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/cloudforce-one/rules/approvals/{id}
Get a single rule approval with current rule data.
Required: account_id (path) — Cloudflare account ID.; id (path) — The unique identifier for the approval.
